# Error-code ledger: the committed, append-only record of every SDK error code.
# Format: <module under sdk/> <CONSTANT_NAME> <code> [retired]
# Add new codes with `./gradlew errorCatalogDump`. Never edit a code, and never delete a line:
# a code that is no longer declared is marked `retired` and stays reserved. See docs/ERROR_CODE_REFERENCE.md.
core UNKNOWN 1000
core INVALID_CONFIG 1001
core CANCELLED_BY_USER 1002
core NETWORK_UNAVAILABLE 2000
core GATEWAY_FAILURE 2001
core TIMEOUT 2002
features/event-logging STORAGE_FAILURE 2101
features/event-logging DELIVERY_IN_PROGRESS 2102
features/event-logging DELIVERY_FAILURE 2103
features/event-logging SCHEDULER_FAILURE 2104
features/logging-file STORAGE_FAILURE 2201
features/otp OTP_INVALID 3000
features/otp OTP_EXPIRED 3001
features/otp OTP_ATTEMPTS_EXCEEDED 3002
features/otp OTP_RESEND_TOO_SOON 3003
features/event-logging INVALID_EVENT 3101
features/event-logging QUEUE_FULL 3103
features/logging-file INVALID_CONFIG 3201
features/logging-file DIRECTORY_IN_USE 3203
features/logging-file CRASH_HANDLER_UNAVAILABLE 3204
features/logging-file INVALID_CRASH_ID 3205
core NOT_STARTED 4000
core ALREADY_RUNNING 4001
core SESSION_CLOSED 4002
